(Bug #76, the headline: a `map` parameter fell to VarType::Unknown, and
 every property dispatch reads Unknown as the FILE branch, so `'s length`
 emitted a call to `_file_size`. That symbol is only linked when the
 program uses files, so this program did not fail to run — it failed to
 ASSEMBLE, with no Vox diagnostic and a NASM error naming a symbol that
 appears nowhere in the source. This test exists to prove it builds.)

To 'count the entries' with a map called grades.
    Print grades's length.

A map called 'the class' is {"ada": 1, "bea": 2}.
'count the entries' of 'the class'.
Exit 0.
